 ## Background
-This method was developed as part of the Skymap project's volume raymarch acceleration efforts, specifically addressing aliasing and performance in GPU-based volume rendering. It was introduced in Pull Request #556 by rulkens, co-authored with Claude Fable, in August 2026 [S1, unofficial]. The technique builds on earlier work in GPU pyramids and TF-adaptive skipping [S1, unofficial].
